container.email-container
  = render 'mailer/layouts/end_user/logo', { resource: @resource }
  row
    columns.email-content
      p
        | Welcome 
        = @email
        | !
      p
        | You can confirm your account email through the link below:

  row
        columns
          |  <button class="radius small" href 
          = confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token, domain: Settings.domain, subdomain: @resource.try(:clients).try(:first).try(:subdomain)) 
          |  > 
          = 'Confirm my account'
